pagination, use ",[318,326,315],{}," directly.",[329,330,332],"h2",{"id":331},"usage","Usage",[334,335,337],"h3",{"id":336},"server-side-pagination","Server-side pagination",[308,339,340,341,344,345,348,349,352,353,356,357,360],{},"Pagination is handled by the back end: the component emits ",[318,342,343],{},"page-change",", and the page updates ",[318,346,347],{},"page"," and ",[318,350,351],{},"data"," after the query for that page succeeds. It is not emitted while loading, or when the page is the current one or out of range. ",[318,354,355],{},"interactionDisabled"," is ",[318,358,359],{},"true"," while loading and can be used to disable actions in the list.",[362,363],"component-example",{"name":364},"list-card-basic",[308,366,367,368,371,372,375,376,379,380,384],{},"The ",[318,369,370],{},"PageRequest"," type can be imported from ",[318,373,374],{},"#shuo-ui\u002Ftypes\u002Fpagination","; see ",[312,377,72],{"href":378},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fadvanced\u002Fauto-imports#types",". For the full pattern with query fields, see ",[312,381,383],{"href":382},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Flayout\u002Fquery-card#with-listcard","With ListCard"," on ShuoQueryCard.",[334,386,388],{"id":387},"title-and-icon","Title and icon",[308,390,391,394,395,398,399,375,402,406],{},[318,392,393],{},"title"," is the title text and ",[318,396,397],{},"icon"," is the icon to the left of the title; pass an empty string to hide the icon. The title bar wraps by the same rules as ",[318,400,401],{},"ShuoQueryCard",[312,403,405],{"href":404},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Flayout\u002Fquery-card#long-titles","Long titles",".",[362,408],{"name":409},"list-card-title",[334,411,413],{"id":412},"pagination-and-counts","Pagination and counts",[308,415,416,419,420,423,424,427],{},[318,417,418],{},"show-pagination"," controls the pagination at the bottom left, shown even with a single page; ",[318,421,422],{},"show-summary"," controls the count and range at the bottom right; ",[318,425,426],{},"page-size"," is th